US-0301: Difficulty scaling

As a player, I want the game to get harder over time, so it stays engaging.

AC: Spawn rate and/or enemy speed increases with time/score; still fair.

US-0302: Touch controls (optional)

As a mobile player, I want touch controls, so I can play on phone.

AC: On-screen left/right + shoot or drag-to-move; doesn’t break keyboard.

US-0303: Basic effects

As a player, I want hit feedback, so gameplay feels satisfying.

AC: Explosion/flash or shake on hit; no major FPS drop.

US-0304: Asset theming

As a visitor, I want consistent visuals, so the site feels cohesive.

AC: Shared fonts/colors; game UI matches site style.
